# --- board/actions/ and board/optimize/ (Tasks 9-10, 10b) ---------------------------------------
# `DrillItemMover`'s and `TraceShover`'s **check** halves landed in Task 9, `ForcedPadRouter`'s and
# `ForcedViaInserter`'s in Task 10. The mutating halves split two ways, per **controller ruling AA**:
# `ForcedViaInserter.insert`, `ForcedPadRouter.forcedPad`, `TraceShover.insert` and
# `DrillItemMover.{insert,shoveVias}` are one chain Plan 6 needs (Task 15 reaches it at
# `FoundConnectionInserter.java:754`), and **Task 10b ported all five**.
# `TraceShover.springOverObstacles` followed in **Task 15b** under controller ruling AB, because
# `RoutingBoard.insertForcedTracePolyline:522-524` calls it on every polyline it inserts, so
# `TraceShover`'s deferral roster is now **empty**.
