ForcedPadRouter                   board_ext/forced_pad_router.rs
DrillItemMover                    board_ext/drill_item_mover.rs
TraceShover                       board_ext/trace_shover.rs
# The pull-tight family (Task 15a, **controller ruling AB**). Ruling 2 had put all of
# `board/optimize`'s mutating half in Plan 7; Task 15 found that Java's trace insertion
# pull-tightens every polyline unconditionally, so ruling AB moved these four classes — and
# `PolylineTrace.pullTight`, whose Rust home is `board_ext/tightener/mod.rs` because its argument
# is a `TraceTightener` — into Plan 6. `ViaOptimizer` stays Plan 7's, and so do `optChangedArea`'s
# batch callers and `removeItemsAndPullTight`; `optChangedArea` itself keeps its
# `// added in Plan 7:` marker in `board_ext/tightener/mod.rs`.
